        'directions': list([
          '[lightly] FRY PORK LIVER, REMOVE SKIN AND SINEWS FIRST.',
          'CRUSH PEPPER AND RUE IN A MORTAR WITH [a little] BROTH, THEN ADD THE LIVER, POUND AND MIX.',
