        'directions': list([
          'SCRUB AND WASH BUNDLES OF BEETS BY RUBBING THEM WITH A LITTLE SODA [2].',
          'TIE THEM IN INDIVIDUAL BUNDLES, PUT INTO WATER TO BE COOKED.',
