      'raw': dict({
        'cook_time': None,
        'directions': list([
          'The cereal [2] is soaked; chickpeas, lentils and peas are crushed and boiled with it.',
          'When well cooked, add plenty of oil.',
          'Now cut green herbs, leeks, coriander, dill, fennel, beets, mallows, cabbage strunks, all soft and green and finely cut, and put in a pot.',
          'The cabbage cook [separately. Also] crush fennel seed, origany, sylphium and lovage.',
          'And when crushed, add broth to taste, pour this over the porridge, stir it together and use some finely chopped cabbage stems to sprinkle on top [2].',
        ]),
