      'raw': dict({
        'cook_time': None,
        'directions': list([
          'Julian pulses are cooked thus: Soak well-cleaned spelt, put it on the fire; when cooked, add oil.',
          'If it threatens to become thick, carefully thin it down.',
          'Take two cooked brains and 1/2 pound of meat ground as for forcemeat, crush this with the brains and put in a pot.',
