          'Also crush pepper, lovage, origany and ginger, dilute with the broth of pork, tie [4].',
          'Take a square baking dish suitable for turning over which oil well and line with caul [5].',
          'Sprinkle [on the bottom] a layer of crushed nuts upon which put some peas, fully covering the bottom of the squash dish.',
