            'text': 'POUR OVER [the {{ing_01|roast bird}}] THIS GRAVY: CRUSH {{ing_02|PEPPER}}, {{ing_03|LOVAGE}}, {{ing_04|ORIGANY}} WITH {{ing_05|BROTH}}, {{ing_06|HONEY}}, {{ing_07|A LITTLE VINEGAR}} AND {{ing_08|OIL}}; BOIL IT WELL, THICKEN WITH {{ing_09|ROUX}} [strain] IN THIS SAUCE PLACE SMALL PIECES OF {{ing_10|PARBOILED PUMPKIN OR COLOCASIUM}} [1] SO THAT THEY ARE FINISHED IN THE SAUCE; ALSO COOK WITH IT {{ing_11|CHICKEN FEET}} AND {{ing_12|GIBLETS}} (all of which) SERVE IN A CHAFING DISH, SPRINKLE WITH {{ing_13|FINE PEPPER}} AND SERVE.',
          }),
        ]),
      }),
