      'raw': dict({
        'cook_time': None,
        'directions': list([
          'A fresh ham is cooked with 2 pounds of barley and 25 figs.',
          'When done skin, glaze the surface with a fire shovel full of glowing coals, spread honey over it, or, what’s better: put it in the oven covered with honey.',
          'When it has a nice color, put in a sauce pan raisin wine, pepper, a bunch of rue and pure wine to taste.',
