      'raw': dict({
        'cook_time': None,
        'directions': list([
          'Prepare, remove the entrails by the throat before the carcass hardens (immediately after killing).',
          'Make an opening under the ear, fill an ox bladder with Tarentine sausage meat and attach a tube such as the bird keeper uses to the neck of the bladder and squeeze the dressing into the ear as much as it will take to fill the body.',
          'Then seal the opening with parchment, close securely (with skewers) and prepare (the roast for the oven).',
          '**The Other Dressing**',
          'Crush pepper, lovage, origany, laser root.',
          'Moisten with a little broth.',
          'Add cooked brains, raw eggs, cooked spelt, gravy of the pig, small birds (if any), nuts, whole pepper, and season with broth.',
          'Stuff the pig, close the opening with parchment and skewers and put it in the oven.',
          'When done, dress and garnish very nicely, glaze the body and serve.',
        ]),
