      'raw': dict({
        'cook_time': None,
        'directions': list([
          'Whole (pine) nuts, almonds, chopped nuts or beechnuts, whole pepper are mixed with the (force) meat of hare thickened with eggs and wrapped in pig’s caul to be roasted in the oven.',
          'Another forcemeat is made with rue, plenty of pepper, onion, satury, dates, broth, reduced wine, or spiced wine.',
